# Licensing

This repository contains code under two separate licenses.

## Vendored upstream (`opensourcecobol4j/` tree)

The `opensourcecobol4j/` directory is a vendored snapshot of
[opensource COBOL 4J](https://github.com/opensourcecobol/opensourcecobol4j),
including the CardDemo sample app under `carddemo-app/` and the `libcobj`
Java runtime library.

  * `libcobj/` — runtime library, **LGPL v3** (see `opensourcecobol4j/COPYING.LIB`)
  * everything else under `opensourcecobol4j/` — **GPL v3** (see `opensourcecobol4j/COPYING`)

Upstream commit + licensing details: `opensourcecobol4j/VENDORED.md`.

## Converter tooling (`opensourcecobol4j/tools/web-ui/` + repo root)

Everything we wrote — the web UI, the Express server, the AI conversion
pipeline, scan/graph/run/review modules, and the supporting documentation —
is intended to be used alongside the vendored runtime above. Because the
web-UI tooling orchestrates GPL'd binaries via subprocess calls (`cobc`,
`cobj`, the libcobj JAR) and does not statically link them, we treat the
tooling as a separate work and distribute it under the same GPL v3
terms as the upstream it depends on.

If you redistribute this repository, ship the licenses above with it.

## No warranty

Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. See the included license
texts for full terms.
